WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.713
The Dashboard shows where every order stands, at a glance.

00:00:04.164 --> 00:00:07.902
Pick DTP, GMBH, or All, at the top.

00:00:08.354 --> 00:00:14.426
Each box is one number, like the open sale, the open orders, or the orders past their ship date.

00:00:14.877 --> 00:00:19.033
Click a box, for example Past ship date, to see the orders behind it.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:21.178
The list opens on the side.

00:00:21.178 --> 00:00:23.498
Close it to go back to the Dashboard.
